From 74d4bae22256af2cf3a94af4b5d94eb951c478f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:54:46 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] services: Overview description as bullet points

New points_th / points_en per service, rendered as a diamond-bullet list
in the detail page Overview. desc is unchanged (homepage cards, child
listings). Thai points are desc split into its phrases; the six surgical
treatments, whose desc only repeats the title, take theirs from summary.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ai4dd2uVdcpJDsLT126utA
---
 src/app/[locale]/services/[slug]/page.tsx |  28 ++-
 src/data/services.ts                      | 204 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/types/service.ts                      |   2 +
 3 files changed, 226 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

